    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Immediately after you cast Divine Smite, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to distribute Temporary Hit Points among creatures of your choice within 30 feet of you, which can include you. The total equals 2d8 plus your Paladin level, divided among them as you like.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ocZXBp1qD1LfN1TS\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Divide the total among the chosen creatures yourself.</p></section>",
